P.append(page('The Devdha vector kit: what keeps it consistent','style rules and motion presets',
 '<div class="cols"><div><h2 style="font-size:14px">Look</h2><ul class="lang" style="padding-left:16px"><li><b>No outlines.</b> Chunky, rounded flat shapes; one big circle behind every story.</li><li><b>Palette:</b> navy, Devdha blue, olive, mustard, terracotta, cream, warm skin tones, coral. Every story uses 4–5 of these.</li><li><b>Characters:</b> friendly faces with eyebrows, rosy cheeks, a smile, sometimes a wink; hands with finger lines; texture strokes on clothes.</li><li><b>Diverse cast:</b> different skin tones, hair and ages (adults, team, child).</li><li><b>Details:</b> steam wisps, sparkles, hearts, hatch marks.</li><li>One shared parts library (bust, face, hands, mug, hair styles) so new products stay on-style.</li></ul><div class="sw">'+''.join(f'<i style="background:{c}"></i>' for c in ['#0A2A5E','#1D2FC4','#6B7545','#FDB022','#D9782B','#F7F1DF','#CC6B1F','#E2583E'])+'</div></div><div><h2 style="font-size:14px">Motion presets (same on every story)</h2>'+tbl(['Preset','What it does'],[['pop-in','circle grows from 0; character/product scales .85 → 1 with a small overshoot, 0.4 s'],['breathe','±4 px body float, 2.4 s loop'],['blink / wink','blink every 3 s; wink once on the beat'],['steam','wisp waves upward on a 1.4 s loop'],['swing','pendulum ±8° for tags, badges, frames'],['twinkle','sparkles scale and fade, offset phases'],['draw-on','lines and paths draw in (layers, strings, charts)'],['point','arrow bounces 3× at the zone edge; edge glow pulses gold'],['exit','circle shrinks and slides toward the arrow direction (up, right or down)']])+'<div class="warn"><b>Timing per story:</b> 0.5 s in · 2.2 s action · 0.8 s point · 0.5 s out = 4 s (3D print stories 5 s).</div></div></div>'))
